or=&#8221;#2a98ac&#8221; width=&#8221;100%&#8221; max_width=&#8221;1080px&#8221; module_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;0px||||false|false&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px|0px||0px|false|true&#8221; header_text_shadow_style=&#8221;preset1&#8243; border_width_all=&#8221;6px&#8221; border_color_all=&#8221;#2a98ac&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1>MEMBERSHIP BENEFITS<\/h1>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#2a98ac&#8221; height=&#8221;100px&#8221; max_height=&#8221;100px&#8221; custom_margin=&#8221;0px||||false|false&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px|||69px|false|false&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_code _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][\/et_pb_code][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;]<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>There are 3 Membership Tiers: Volunteer, Social (Friend) and Comprehensive (Client).<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_3,1_3,1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; max_width=&#8221;2560px&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; text_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; link_text_color=&#8221;#fdd237&#8243; header_6_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;||19px|||&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Social Life &amp; Friendships<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Friendships are formed and enriched when WPV members\u00a0 and volunteers come together and enjoy one another&#8217;s company by engaging in shared interests, social events, group outings, and friendly visits.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; text_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; link_text_color=&#8221;#fdd237&#8243; header_6_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;||19px|||&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Health &amp; Wellbeing <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">In today&#8217;s world, aging requires more than good medical care. The sense of community that comes from Village membership improves one&#8217;s quality of life and wellbeing as a whole as we progress through each decade.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; text_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; link_text_color=&#8221;#fdd237&#8243; header_6_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;||19px|||&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Educational Events<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Members have a variety of opportunities to learn about topics of interest ranging from health and wellbeing, internet safety, legacy planning, emergency preparedness, Medicare and more.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_3,1_3,1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; max_width=&#8221;2560px&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; text_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; link_text_color=&#8221;#fdd237&#8243; header_6_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;||19px|||&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Home Services &amp; Maintenance <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Village members live in a variety of settings. WPV supports many aspects of maintenance, errands and chores to ensure that every member&#8217;s house, apartment, condo, or assisted living facility continues to feels like home.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; text_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; link_text_color=&#8221;#fdd237&#8243; header_6_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;||19px|||&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Service Referrals <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Members can access information about local businesses and organizations that are trusted and recommended\u00a0by other community members.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; text_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;22px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.2em&#8221; link_text_color=&#8221;#fdd237&#8243; header_6_text_color=&#8221;#293273&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;||19px|||&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Transportation <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Members are supported with transportation, providing the freedom to make plans, appointments, stay active, meet up with other individuals, and stay involved with their interests. Free to WPV events; extra charge for personal trips.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; custom_margin=&#8221;|368px||auto||&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;|||325px|false|false&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;20px&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Download our brochure for more information here: <a href=\"https:\/\/thewpv.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/24-0821-WPV-Trifold-2-pages.pdf\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">WPV Brochure<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/h3>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_3,1_3,1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243; max_width=&#8221;2560px&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/thewpv.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-10-31-at-10.50.46\u202fAM-300&#215;237.png&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][\/et_pb_image][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559731&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335562764&quot;:2,&quot;335562765&quot;:1,&quot;335562766&quot;:4,&quot;335562767&quot;:0,&quot;335562768&quot;:4,&quot;335562769&quot;:0}\"><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">\u201cWPV Tech wizard David <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">Duran came to the rescue and <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">solved all my computer and <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">ipad<\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\"> issues! So appreciate this <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">WPV service.\u201d <\/span>\u200b<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559731&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335562764&quot;:2,&quot;335562765&quot;:1,&quot;335562766&quot;:4,&quot;335562767&quot;:0,&quot;335562768&quot;:4,&quot;335562769&quot;:0}\"><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">\u2013 WPV Member<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/thewpv.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Screenshot-2024-10-31-at-10.51.59\u202fAM-300&#215;254.png&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;][\/et_pb_image][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.0.11&#8243;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559731&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335562764&quot;:2,&quot;335562765&quot;:1,&quot;335562766&quot;:4,&quot;335562767&quot;:0,&quot;335562768&quot;:4,&quot;335562769&quot;:0}\"><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">\u201cOur Monthly On the Move <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">group is a chance to have a <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">fun day out and see <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">interesting cultural attractions <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">around LA.\u201d <\/span>\u200b<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559683&quot;:0,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559731&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335562764&quot;:2,&quot;335562765&quot;:1,&quot;335562766&quot;:4,&quot;335562767&quot;:0,&quot;335562768&quot;:4,&quot;335562769&quot;:0}\"><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">&#8211; WPV <\/span><span data-usefontface=\"false\" data-contrast=\"none\">Member<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_p